  "answer": "Yes, you can request a refund on your Classic ticket if you're sick, but there are specific conditions. Refunds for Classic tickets are allowed if requested at least 24 hours before departure, with a fee of EUR 90 per passenger deducted. If you request the refund less than 24 hours before departure, only the taxes will be refundable, under the same conditions as the Light fare. Please note that refunds are paid to the original form of payment within 14 days, or you may choose a travel voucher worth 110% of the refund amount, valid for 12 months on Corvina-operated flights only. Please contact our customer service to initiate the refund process and provide any necessary documentation related to your illness.",
  "policy_covers_question": true
}
